    <string name="settings_privacy_info_subtitle">Learn how Scanova protects your data without internet access</string>
    <string name="settings_privacy_dialog_body">• 100%% On-Device Processing: All QR code and barcode detection happens locally using bundled Google ML Kit models without uploading images to any server.\n\n• Local Storage: Your scan history is stored exclusively inside an on-device Room database.\n\n• Zero Trackers or Ads: Scanova contains no analytics SDKs, advertising trackers, or mandatory accounts.\n\n• Explicit User Control: No URLs, phone calls, or Wi-Fi networks are ever triggered without your explicit action.</string>

